Jess X Tech license—and the terms governing other practical endeavors—are designed to restrict modifications and strictly protect the integrity of the original license. In contrast, the Jess X Tech license is intended to allow for the sharing and modification of all versions of a program, provided that prior notification is given and explicit consent for such changes is obtained. This ensures that the software remains protected by copyright for all its users. For the majority of our software, we enforce strict rules: the use, modification, and unauthorized distribution of the source code are prohibited, and the software must be used exclusively under the terms of the Jess X license. This policy applies to any work released by the original authors under these terms. You may also apply this license to your own programs, but you must first notify Jess X Tech (at Jessamycab@gmail.com) and obtain formal authorization.

We are open to discussing pricing and terms, as well as exploring opportunities for further development. The design is structured to ensure that you are informed—and have the opportunity to address—whether you can obtain the source code (or access it if needed), whether you are permitted to modify the software or use its components in new programs, and whether you are allowed to distribute copies of the software (including the option to charge a fee for doing so).
